{"id":"c157f54ed9c9151a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Quotient Equivalence","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence — ZFC Ideal6 Quotient Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence — ZFC Ideal6 Quotient Equivalence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence — ZFC Ideal6 Quotient Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq X\">\\(A,B\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S(X,\\mathcal I,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq X\\land ((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\in\\mathcal I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S(X,\\mathcal I,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq X\\land ((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\in\\mathcal I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is equality modulo the ideal; the ideal axioms make it an equivalence relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6QuotientEquivalence}_S(X,\\mathcal I,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq X\\land ((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\in\\mathcal I","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":988,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence.md|58-df-zfc-ideal6-quotient-equivalence]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}